NICKNAME;CHARSET=utf-8:;
PHOTO;ENCODING=b:￼
END:VCARD
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N;CHARSET=utf-8:iCloud Link History;;;;
ORG:View your iCloud link history;
